================================================================================
sha1collisiondetection (Marc Stevens & Dan Shumow)
================================================================================

`crates/vcs/src/sha1dc/` translates the SHA-1 unavoidable bit-condition (UBC)
equations, disturbance-vector tables (`tools/data/3565`), and recompression
algorithm from `cr-marcstevens/sha1collisiondetection` (`lib/ubc_check.c`,
`lib/sha1.c`).

